        "html": "<section class=\"section section--dark grit\" id=\"articles\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"shead\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Articles</p>\n        <h2 class=\"tt\">Longer reads, <em>written by the team on site</em></h2>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"shead__note\">Published pieces that go further than the explainers below, with the\n        numbers, the plant and the approvals set out in full.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"capstrip capstrip--3\"><a class=\"capstrip__item reveal\" href=\"https://maxdemolitions.com.au/blog/what-is-a-site-cut/\"><div class=\"capstrip__media\"><img src=\"/uploads/what-is-a-site-cut-and-when-a-sloping-bl-0a7ff41b.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Excavator cutting a level building platform into a sloping Sydney block with a sandstone face exposed on the high side\"></div><div class=\"capstrip__cap\"><span class=\"capstrip__kicker\">Site preparation</span><b>What a site cut is, and when a sloping block needs one</b><span>Cut and fill, grading and compaction, and how a level building platform is actually formed. Why slope and Sydney sandstone change the method and the price.</span><span class=\"capstrip__go\">Read the article <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></div></a><a class=\"capstrip__item reveal\" href=\"https://maxdemolitions.com.au/blog/how-long-does-it-take-to-demolish-a-house/\"><div class=\"capstrip__media\"><img src=\"/uploads/how-long-does-it-take-to-demolish-a-hous-d2adc1c8.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Excavator bringing down a single storey Sydney house while a tipper waits in the driveway to load debris\"></div><div class=\"capstrip__cap\"><span class=\"capstrip__kicker\">Timelines</span><b>How long it takes to demolish a house in Sydney</b><span>The machine work is the short part of the job. Approvals, service disconnections, asbestos and clearance are what really set the programme.</span><span class=\"capstrip__go\">Read the article <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></div></a><a class=\"capstrip__item reveal\" href=\"https://maxdemolitions.com.au/blog/what-is-friable-asbestos/\"><div class=\"capstrip__media\"><img src=\"/uploads/what-is-friable-asbestos-and-why-it-is-t-410e1deb.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Deteriorated asbestos pipe lagging exposed in a ceiling cavity of an older Sydney building\"></div><div class=\"capstrip__cap\"><span class=\"capstrip__kicker\">Hazardous materials</span><b>What friable asbestos is, and why it is treated differently</b><span>Friable is a category set by condition rather than by the material itself. Why NSW asks for a Class A licence, full enclosure, air monitoring and independent clearance.</span><span class=\"capstrip__go\">Read the article <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></div></a><a class=\"capstrip__item reveal\" href=\"https://maxdemolitions.com.au/blog/house-demolition-cost-sydney/\"><div class=\"capstrip__media\"><img src=\"/uploads/house-demolition-cost-in-sydney-what-act-f08426e4.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Excavator demolishing a brick and tile house on a suburban Sydney block with debris stacked across the slab\"></div><div class=\"capstrip__cap\"><span class=\"capstrip__kicker\">Pricing</span><b>House demolition cost in Sydney: what actually moves the price</b><span>Access, asbestos, spoil and approvals, and how a demolition quote is really built. Where homeowners and builders most often get caught out.</span><span class=\"capstrip__go\">Read the article <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></div></a><a class=\"capstrip__item reveal\" href=\"https://maxdemolitions.com.au/blog/sandstone-excavation-northern-beaches/\"><div class=\"capstrip__media\"><img src=\"/uploads/rock-excavation-on-the-northern-beaches--da39c601.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Excavator fitted with a rock hammer breaking sandstone on a sloping Northern Beaches block above the coast\"></div><div class=\"capstrip__cap\"><span class=\"capstrip__kicker\">Excavation</span><b>Rock excavation on the Northern Beaches: sandstone, shale and what changes</b><span>Hit sandstone a metre down and the plant, the programme and the neighbours all change. Hammers against rippers, access, vibration and noise.</span><span class=\"capstrip__go\">Read the article <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></div></a><a class=\"capstrip__item reveal\" href=\"https://maxdemolitions.com.au/blog/asbestos-testing-before-renovation/\"><div class=\"capstrip__media\"><img src=\"/uploads/asbestos-testing-before-you-buy-or-renov-dc25d516.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Asbestos sheeting being sampled on an Australian home before a renovation, with testing equipment laid out\"></div><div class=\"capstrip__cap\"><span class=\"capstrip__kicker\">Hazardous materials</span><b>Asbestos testing before you buy or renovate</b><span>Where fibro hides in Australian homes, bonded against friable, how sampling works and what a clearance certificate actually covers.</span><span class=\"capstrip__go\">Read the article <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></div></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
